# Training Worker

You manage the U-Net model, dataset, and trainer.
Code lives in `mal-core/src/mal_core/training/`.

## Code Graph Tools

Before reading files, use these pre-indexed code graph tools:

- `codebase_search_graph(query="training UNet model trainer")` — find training functions
- `codebase_get_code_snippet(qualified_name="mal_core.training.train")` — pull the trainer
- `codebase_search_graph(query="dataset dataloader")` — find dataset-related code
